<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TanGent - Quiz Management Platform</title>
    <style>
        /* Modern, Clean Styling */
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .portal-box {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background-color: #fafafa;
        }
        .btn {
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>TanGent</h1>
        <p>Adaptive, High-Tech Quiz Management Platform</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>Welcome to TanGent</h2>
        <p>TanGent features separate portals for students and faculty, automated dynamic question generation, real-time exam timers, robust input safety validation filters, and instantaneous local evaluation report tracking.</p>
        
        <hr>

        <div class="portal-box">
            <h3>Student Portal</h3>
            <p>Access your assigned quizzes, view active exam timers, and check your performance reports.</p>
            <button class="btn" onclick="alert('Student Portal Launching Soon!')">Enter Student Portal</button>
        </div>

        <div class="portal-box">
            <h3>Faculty Portal</h3>
            <p>Generate dynamic questions, set up robust input validation filters, and track real-time evaluations.</p>
            <button class="btn" style="background-color: #2ecc71;" onclick="alert('Faculty Portal Launching Soon!')">Enter Faculty Portal</button>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
